ammed. The goal of machine learning is to enable machines to automatically improve their performance on a task by learning from examples and experience.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-434bec15-4b2c-437d-98dc-8867469595c3-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1750, 'output_tokens': 57, 'total_tokens': 1807, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='what is Deep learning ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='18446304-756e-444a-ba99-578775d14c06'), AIMessage(content='Deep Learning is a subfield of machine learning that uses artificial neural networks with multiple layers (deep neural networks) to analyze data and make predictions. These networks are inspired by the structure and function of the human brain and are capable of learning complex patterns from large amounts of data. Deep learning models excel at tasks such as image recognition, natural language processing, and speech recognition.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-e29e214c-2224-43e5-988b-f1e55daf4739-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1728, 'output_tokens': 75, 'total_tokens': 1803, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='what is AI', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='ff43eb53-447b-47d1-97ed-148dc8de03b9'), AIMessage(content='AI, or Artificial Intelligence, refers to the development of computer systems that can perform tasks that typically require human intelligence. This includes:\n\n1. **Learning**: AI systems can learn from data and improve their performance over time.\n2. **Reasoning**: AI systems can draw inferences and make decisions based on the data they have been trained on.\n3. **Problem-solving**: AI systems can identify and solve problems, often using a combination of logic and learning.\n4. **Perception**: AI systems can interpret and understand data from sensors, such as images, speech, and text.\n\nAI can be categorized into several types, including:\n\n1. **Narrow or Weak AI**: Designed to perform a specific task, such as playing chess or recognizing faces.\n2. **General or Strong AI**: A hypothetical AI system that can perform any intellectual task that a human can.\n3. **Superintelligence**: An AI system that significantly surpasses human intelligence in many domains.\n\nAI technologies are commonly used in:\n\n1. **Virtual assistants**: Such as Siri, Alexa, and Google Assistant.\n2. **Image recognition**: Used in self-driving cars and facial recognition systems.\n3. **Natural language processing**: Used in chatbots and language translation systems.\n4. **Predictive analytics**: Used in finance, healthcare, and marketing to analyze data and make predictions.\n5. **Robotics**: Used in industrial and service robotics to perform tasks that require physical labor.\n\nThe benefits of AI include:\n\n1. **Increased efficiency**: AI can automate tasks, freeing up human time for more complex and creative work.\n2. **Improved accuracy**: AI can analyze large amounts of data and make more accurate decisions than humans.\n3. **Enhanced customer experience**: AI-powered chatbots and virtual assistants can provide 24/7 customer support.\n4. **New business opportunities**: AI can enable new business models and revenue streams.\n\nHowever, AI also raises concerns about:\n\n1. **Job displacement**: AI could automate tasks, potentially displacing human workers.\n2. **Bias and fairness**: AI systems can perpetuate biases and discrimination if they are trained on biased data.\n3. **Security and privacy**: AI systems can be vulnerable to cyber attacks and data breaches.\n4. **Accountability**: AI systems can be difficult to hold accountable for their decisions and actions.\n\nOverall, AI has the potential to revolutionize many industries and aspects of our lives, but it also requires careful consideration of its benefits and risks.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-07aeaf44-f5c5-4126-a960-0b2e1539d220-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1586, 'output_tokens': 519, 'total_tokens': 2105, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='what is', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='844bbe55-acde-432e-b63f-8fac49775dea'), AIMessage(content='Machine learning (ML) is a subset of artificial intelligence (AI) that enables systems to learn from data, improve their performance on a task over time, and make predictions or decisions with minimal human intervention. It involves training algorithms to identify patterns, relationships, and trends in data, allowing them to make informed decisions or take actions.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-d183a1fe-f494-4166-a24e-5ee8d12a8027-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2114, 'output_tokens': 67, 'total_tokens': 2181, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), AIMessage(content=['The query is incomplete. Can you please specify what you are asking about?'], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='8cbcc501-70c9-4021-83ba-748857317e1e'), HumanMessage(content='recommend spicy dishes ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='74859689-4b8a-48cc-8e8d-5c58fcdbb9a2'), AIMessage(content='Okay, I can recommend some spicy dishes for you: Chicken Vindaloo, Spicy Ramen, Phaal Curry, Sichuan Hot Pot, Mexican Tacos with Salsa, and Buffalo Wings.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-993250b3-5b0e-4528-98bb-9686695f67ae-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 933, 'output_tokens': 36, 'total_tokens': 969, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='give me an recipe of paneer butter masala', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='948a3b4a-11f0-4cf1-b743-8448b50821a6')], 'query_type': 'recipy_agent', 'human_feedback': [HumanMessage(content='Machine learning ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='5d68bd77-f3f1-4ef4-8e56-8a3cc4b6be6c'), HumanMessage(content='Machine learning ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='68875b93-fdda-444b-bfa6-1cece52e6914')]}
