gs={}, response_metadata={}, id='579c8a85-2560-4ed6-8b6c-3b33389500e9'), AIMessage(content='', additional_kwargs={'function_call': {'name': 'human_feedback', 'arguments': '{"message": "Could you please specify what kind of application you\'re interested in? Are you looking for a specific industry, type of AI, or a particular use case?"}'}}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-24ea41af-4a42-4dac-8d16-21e1c3310fc6-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'human_feedback', 'args': {'message': "Could you please specify what kind of application you're interested in? Are you looking for a specific industry, type of AI, or a particular use case?"}, 'id': 'e5412b47-468a-4d81-b5b5-1ef61657031f', 'type': 'tool_call'}], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 668, 'output_tokens': 36, 'total_tokens': 704, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), ToolMessage(content='anything', name='human_feedback', id='a698ffee-e740-477a-a1ad-eb26d9c80d78', tool_call_id='e5412b47-468a-4d81-b5b5-1ef61657031f'), AIMessage(content='', additional_kwargs={'function_call': {'name': 'general_AI', 'arguments': '{"message": "AI is used in spam filtering to identify and filter out unwanted emails."}'}}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-4861fc7c-ecd5-4541-917b-1b28085a1fed-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'general_AI', 'args': {'message': 'AI is used in spam filtering to identify and filter out unwanted emails.'}, 'id': '87f01fc5-ac67-4dfa-ab3b-8d31d62ddc23', 'type': 'tool_call'}], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 709, 'output_tokens': 18, 'total_tokens': 727, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), ToolMessage(content='content="That\'s correct. AI, or more specifically, machine learning (ML) and natural language processing (NLP) techniques, are widely used in spam filtering to identify and filter out unwanted emails. Here\'s how it works:\\n\\n1. **Training data**: ML algorithms are trained on a large dataset of labeled emails, where some are marked as spam and others as legitimate.\\n2. **Pattern recognition**: The algorithms learn to recognize patterns in the spam emails, such as specific keywords, phrases, and formatting.\\n3. **Predictive modeling**: The trained model is then used to predict whether a new, incoming email is likely to be spam or not based on its content and characteristics.\\n4. **Continuous learning**: The model is continuously updated and refined as new emails are received and labeled, allowing it to adapt to evolving spam tactics.\\n\\nAI-powered spam filtering uses various techniques, including:\\n\\n1. **Keyword analysis**: Identifying specific words or phrases that are commonly found in spam emails.\\n2. **Behavioral analysis**: Analyzing the behavior of the sender, such as the frequency and timing of emails.\\n3. **Content analysis**: Examining the content of the email, including the subject line, body, and attachments.\\n4. **Network analysis**: Analyzing the sender\'s IP address, domain, and other network-related information.\\n\\nBy combining these techniques, AI-powered spam filtering can effectively identify and filter out unwanted emails, protecting users from spam, phishing, and other types of malicious email campaigns." additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={\'token_usage\': {\'completion_tokens\': 300, \'prompt_tokens\': 49, \'total_tokens\': 349, \'completion_time\': 0.493515324, \'prompt_time\': 0.00292741, \'queue_time\': 0.050823435, \'total_time\': 0.496442734}, \'model_name\': \'llama-3.1-8b-instant\', \'system_fingerprint\': \'fp_510c177af0\', \'finish_reason\': \'stop\', \'logprobs\': None} id=\'run-f7905f69-78a8-40b7-bd15-05004c52bb7f-0\' usage_metadata={\'input_tokens\': 49, \'output_tokens\': 300, \'total_tokens\': 349}'