9.  **Active Learning**: The algorithm selects which data points to label next.\n10. **Explainable Machine Learning**: Focuses on understanding the decisions made by a model.\n11. **Robot Learning**: The algorithm learns to control a physical robot.\n12. **Meta-Learning**: The algorithm learns to learn from a variety of tasks.\n13. **Multimodal Learning**: The algorithm learns to recognize and process multiple types of data.\n14. **Cognitive Architectures**: The algorithm is designed to mimic the structure and function of the human brain.\n15. **Evolutionary Computation**: The algorithm uses evolutionary principles to search for good solutions.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-a048c74d-d3db-410b-b926-943986772d00-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1804, 'output_tokens': 315, 'total_tokens': 2119, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='my name is prit', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='f97837cf-b6e7-4826-a460-162ca7a69f79'), HumanMessage(content='What is AI', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='7df502c3-b94e-4626-801b-e17a7ad7849a'), AIMessage(content='AI has numerous applications across various industries, including healthcare (medical diagnosis, personalized medicine), education (personalized learning, intelligent tutoring), finance (risk management, portfolio management), customer service (chatbots, sentiment analysis), transportation (self-driving cars, route optimization), manufacturing (predictive maintenance, quality control), cybersecurity (threat detection, incident response), marketing (predictive analytics, personalized marketing), home automation (smart homes, energy efficiency), and environmental conservation (climate modeling, conservation efforts).', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'b