1, 'output_tokens': 52, 'total_tokens': 493, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='recommend romantic movies', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='f1797280-6db3-47b6-92e9-859f912bb45f'), AIMessage(content="OK. Based on your request for romantic movies, I recommend the following: Untaken Paths, Time to Love, I'm Not Angry!, Subdued, Sperm Whale, Wing Mirror, Lantouri, Dance with Me, Bomb: A Love Story, The Painting Pool.", additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-7142db7a-d3fe-4a0a-84dd-f4861896e59c-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 454, 'output_tokens': 57, 'total_tokens': 511, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='give me an information about 3 idiots movie', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='1f714608-4942-4699-9653-8b5d2e1d992f'), AIMessage(content='OK. Here is some information about the movie "3 Idiots": "3 Idiots" is a 2009 Indian Hindi-language comedy-drama film directed by Rajkumar Hirani, co-written by Abhijat Joshi, and produced by Vidhu Vinod Chopra. It\'s loosely based on Chetan Bhagat\'s novel "Five Point Someone." The film follows the story of three engineering students and explores themes of friendship, academic pressure, societal expectations, and the importance of following one\'s dreams. The movie was a commercial and critical success, praised for its humor, heartwarming story, and social commentary.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-213038fb-71ee-4f5f-94c0-0066122f8c6d-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1376, 'output_tokens': 129, 'total_tokens': 1505, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='my name is prit', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='64e8cc25-9ac2-4cbd-9db0-2ccccaa07b52'), AIMessage(content='OK, I will remember your name is Prit. How can I help you today?', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-a0ff89f3-d54f-4cf5-96cc-5d7ef5113a92-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 899, 'output_tokens': 18, 'total_tokens': 917, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), AIMessage(content=['❓ Please clarify: Hi Prit, how can I help you today?'], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='025a72df-fc9e-4ef4-a29d-4b07b5c51cb9'), HumanMessage(content='what is my name', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='4a4be931-a4a5-4494-afdc-d29456dd4d9a'), AIMessage(content='Your name is Prit.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-d25a8171-216e-4325-a006-ee490c4bfb17-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1114, 'output_tokens': 6, 'total_tokens': 1120, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='what is AI', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='714c21bf-4c67-488a-935a-85e9ef31dd7f'), AIMessage(content='AI, or Artificial Intelligence, refers to the simulation of human intelligence in machines that are programmed to think and learn like humans. The term can also be applied to any machine that exhibits traits associated with a human mind such as learning and problem-solving.\n\nAI technology is based on the principle of creating algorithms that enable computers to perform tasks that typically require human intelligence, such as:\n\n1. **Learning**: AI systems can learn from data, identify patterns, and improve their performance over time.\n2. **Reasoning**: AI systems can reason and make decisions based on the data they have learned.\n3. **Problem-solving**: AI systems can solve complex problems by breaking them down into smaller, manageable tasks.\n4. **Perception**: AI systems can perceive and interpret data from the environment, such as images, speech, and text.\n\nThere are several types of AI, including:\n\n1. **Narrow or Weak AI**: Designed to perform a specific task, such as facial recognition or language translation.\n2. **General or Strong AI**: A hypothetical AI system that possesses the ability to understand, learn, and apply knowledge across a wide range of tasks, similar to human intelligence.\n3. **Superintelligence**: A hypothetical AI system that is significantly more intelligent than the best human minds, capable of solving complex problems that are currently unsolvable.\n\nAI is being applied in various fields, including:\n\n1. **Healthcare**: AI-powered diagnosis, personalized medicine, and medical research.\n2. **Finance**: AI-powered trading, risk management, and customer service.\n3. **Autonomous vehicles**: AI-powered self-driving cars and drones.\n4. **Education**: AI-powered adaptive learning, personalized education, and student assessment.\n5. **Customer service**: AI-powered chatbots, virtual assistants, and customer support.\n\nThe benefits of AI include:\n\n1. **Efficiency**: AI can automate repetitive tasks, freeing up human time for more strategic and creative work.\n2. **Accuracy**: AI can perform tasks with a high degree of accuracy, reducing errors and improving outcomes.\n3. **Innovation**: AI can drive innovation by generating new ideas and solutions.\n4. **Accessibility**: AI can improve access to information and services for people with disabilities.\n\nHowever, AI also raises concerns about:\n\n1. **Job displacement**: AI may automate jobs, displacing human workers.\n2. **Bias and fairness**: AI systems can perpetuate biases and injustices if they are trained on biased data.\n3. **Security**: AI systems can be vulnerable to cyber attacks and data breaches.\n4. **Ethics**: AI raises complex ethical questions about accountability, responsibility, and the impact on society.\n\nOverall, AI has the potential to transform industries and improve lives, but it requires careful consideration of its benefits and risks.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-eb552bbc-ec5e-4ba0-b4e2-85c720b05783-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1569, 'output_tokens': 583, 'total_tokens': 2152, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='what is Machine learing', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='500f6512-48aa-450f-adb2-aefd3b10b118')], 'query_type': 'genral_agent', 'human_feedback': [HumanMessage(content='exmple', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='25239160-5d7e-4624-b930-71737e6245ba'), HumanMessage(content='Example or application ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='6f30f52b-c59e-4e77-8d9c-673a07d4c7c8'), HumanMessage(content='Example or application ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='a432e520-cbb7-4858-bb81-2f186befbf0e'), HumanMessage(content='anything', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='f00707a5-0b3c-47ab-82bc-be27100e16a7'), HumanMessage(content='just remember it ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='3423ada0-145f-4037-b55e-e63225450928'), HumanMessage(content='just remember it ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='263de968-42f3-474a-a759-b89361cb364b'), HumanMessage(content='my name', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='d4d0ee98-555c-489a-8dee-7a60ff515afb'), HumanMessage(content='just remember it ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='870689bc-e050-457a-af32-8f9b03bb4c9e'), HumanMessage(content='my name', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='6ec9195a-cadc-443f-bf7b-202c5e35c464'), HumanMessage(content='my name is prit', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='3ad337e0-e99e-4e2c-aa4f-d33a323d2a90'), HumanMessage(content='just remember my name', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='b1b5c587-5525-41d9-a3e8-b3a1ecc588a6'), HumanMessage(content='just remember my name', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='80472c1c-3e76-4f56-9f41-361ced36a5f6'), HumanMessage(content='just remember my name', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='400fe85a-907d-453c-8fc1-564f68bf4989')]}
