h_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-6ef4c509-4e48-4601-a0d8-f02d7f018407-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 342, 'output_tokens': 34, 'total_tokens': 376, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='give me an recipe of mexican tacos with salsa', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='7ff59692-fb03-4797-ae4d-4288fbbaff7a'), AIMessage(content="Here's a recipe for Mexican Tacos with Homemade Salsa:\n\n## Authentic Mexican Tacos with Homemade Salsa\n\nThis recipe focuses on simple, flavorful ingredients and techniques to achieve authentic Mexican taco flavors.\n\n**Yields:** About 8-10 tacos\n**Prep time:** 30 minutes\n**Cook time:** 30-45 minutes\n\n**Ingredients:**\n\n**For the Meat (Carne Asada - Grilled Beef):**\n\n*   1.5 - 2 lbs Flank Steak or Skirt Steak\n*   1/4 cup Orange Juice\n*   1/4 cup Lime Juice\n*   2 cloves Garlic, minced\n*   1 tbsp Olive Oil\n*   1 tbsp Soy Sauce (optional, for extra umami)\n*   1 tsp Cumin\n*   1 tsp Chili Powder\n*   1/2 tsp Dried Oregano\n*   1/4 tsp Black Pepper\n*   Salt to taste\n\n**For the Salsa (Pico de Gallo):**\n\n*   2-3 Roma Tomatoes, diced\n*   1/2 White Onion, finely diced\n*   1-2 Jalapeños, seeded and finely diced (adjust to your spice preference)\n*   1/4 cup Cilantro, chopped\n*   2 tbsp Lime Juice\n*   Salt to taste\n\n**For the Tacos:**\n\n*   8-10 Corn Tortillas (small, street-style tortillas are best)\n*   Optional Toppings:\n    *   Lime wedges\n    *   Chopped White Onion\n    *   Cilantro\n    *   Radishes, thinly sliced\n    *   Queso Fresco, crumbled\n\n**Equipment:**\n\n*   Large bowl or ziplock bag\n*   Grill or cast iron skillet\n*   Cutting board\n*   Knife\n*   Small bowl\n\n**Instructions:**\n\n**1. Marinate the Meat:**\n\n*   In a large bowl or ziplock bag, combine the orange juice, lime juice, minced garlic, olive oil, soy sauce (if using), cumin, chili powder, oregano, black pepper, and salt.\n*   Add the flank or skirt steak to the marinade, ensuring it's fully coated.\n*   Marinate for at least 30 minutes, or up to 4 hours in the refrigerator. The longer it marinates, the more flavorful and tender it will be.\n\n**2. Prepare the Salsa (Pico de Gallo):**\n\n*   In a small bowl, combine the diced tomatoes, diced onion, diced jalapeño (if using), chopped cilantro, and lime juice.\n*   Season with salt to taste.\n*   Stir well and set aside. The flavors will meld together as it sits.\n\n**3. Cook the Meat:**\n\n*   Preheat your grill to high heat or a cast iron skillet over medium-high heat.\n*   Remove the steak from the marinade and pat it dry with paper towels. This will help it sear properly.\n*   Grill or sear the steak for 3-5 minutes per side for medium-rare, or longer depending on your desired level of doneness. Use a meat thermometer to check the internal temperature: 130-135°F for medium-rare, 135-145°F for medium.\n*   Once cooked, remove the steak from the grill or skillet and let it rest for at least 10 minutes before slicing. This allows the juices to redistribute, resulting in a more tender and flavorful steak.\n\n**4. Warm the Tortillas:**\n\n*   While the steak is resting, warm the corn tortillas. You can do this in a dry skillet over medium heat, on a comal (if you have one), or wrapped in a damp paper towel and microwaved for 30 seconds to 1 minute. The goal is to make them pliable and warm.\n\n**5. Slice and Assemble the Tacos:**\n\n*   Thinly slice the steak against the grain. This will ensure it's tender and easy to chew.\n*   Fill each warm tortilla with the sliced steak.\n*   Top with the prepared salsa (Pico de Gallo).\n*   Add any optional toppings you desire, such as lime wedges, chopped onion, cilantro, radishes, or queso fresco.\n\n**6. Serve and Enjoy!**\n\n**Tips and Variations:**\n\n*   **Meat Alternatives:** You can substitute the beef with chicken, pork, or even mushrooms for a vegetarian option. Adjust the marinade and cooking times accordingly.\n*   **Salsa Variations:** Experiment with different types of salsa, such as salsa verde (green salsa) or a roasted tomato salsa.\n*   **Spice Level:** Adjust the amount of jalapeño in the salsa to control the heat. You can also use other types of peppers, such as serrano peppers, for a different flavor profile.\n*   **Tortilla Options:** While corn tortillas are traditional, you can also use flour tortillas if you prefer.\n*   **Marinating Time:** While 30 minutes is the minimum, marinating the steak overnight will result in a more flavorful and tender result.\n*   **Grilling Tips:** If using a charcoal grill, use hardwood lump charcoal for the best flavor.\n*   **Restaurant Style:** For that authentic restaurant taco experience, try lightly charring the tortillas on the grill after warming them.\n\nEnjoy your delicious homemade Mexican tacos! Buen provecho!", additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-5afeda91-fdb9-4e10-b2f3-d5cd49c91d30-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1713, 'output_tokens': 1125, 'total_tokens': 2838, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='my name is prit', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='10a07a65-aacf-4f67-b43a-b15823377f13'), AIMessage(content="That's so sweet of you to offer. I'd love some recommendations for classic romances. I'm always up for a good love story, especially if it's a timeless tale that has stood the test of time. Do you have any suggestions or do you want me to give you some options?", additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-4b0a2e3d-dcab-414d-b21b-edb6e9d23fca-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2271, 'output_tokens': 64, 'total_tokens': 2335, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='what is AI', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='07a8576f-a5c9-4668-a98e-847ceb36964f'), AIMessage(content='Artificial Intelligence (AI) is a broad field of computer science that focuses on creating intelligent machines that can perform tasks that would typically require human intelligence. AI involves the development of algorithms and statistical models that enable computers to learn from data, reason, and interact with the environment in a way that simulates human cognition.\n\nThere are several types of AI, including:\n\n1.  **Narrow or Weak AI**: This type of AI is designed to perform a specific task, such as image recognition, natural language processing, or playing chess. Narrow AI is trained on a specific dataset and is not capable of general reasoning or learning.\n2.  **General or Strong AI**: This type of AI is designed to perform any intellectual task that a human can. General AI is still in the early stages of development and is considered a long-term goal for AI researchers.\n3.  **Superintelligence**: This type of AI is significantly more intelligent than the best human minds and is capable of solving complex problems that are currently unsolvable by humans.\n\nAI typically involves several key components, including:\n\n1.  **Machine Learning (ML)**: This is a type of AI that enables computers to learn from data without being explicitly programmed.\n2.  **Deep Learning (DL)**: This is a type of ML that uses neural networks to analyze and learn from data.\n3.  **Natural Language Processing (NLP)**: This is a type of AI that enables computers to understand and generate human language.\n4.  **Robotics**: This is a type of AI that enables robots to interact with their environment and perform tasks.\n5.  **Computer Vision**: This is a type of AI that enables computers to interpret and understand visual data from images and videos.\n\nAI has many applications in various fields, including:\n\n1.  **Healthcare**: AI is used in medical diagnosis, patient care, and personalized medicine.\n2.  **Finance**: AI is used in risk assessment, portfolio management, and customer service.\n3.  **Transportation**: AI is used in autonomous vehicles, traffic management, and route optimization.\n4.  **Education**: AI is used in personalized learning, grading, and student support.\n5.  **Customer Service**: AI is used in chatbots, virtual assistants, and customer support.\n\nThe benefits of AI include:\n\n1.  **Increased Efficiency**: AI can automate tasks and free up human resources for more strategic work.\n2.  **Improved Accuracy**: AI can analyze large amounts of data and make more accurate predictions and decisions.\n3.  **Enhanced Customer Experience**: AI can provide personalized and responsive customer service.\n4.  **New Business Opportunities**: AI can enable new business models and revenue streams.\n5.  **Scientific Breakthroughs**: AI can help scientists discover new insights and understand complex phenomena.\n\nHowever, AI also raises several concerns, including:\n\n1.  **Job Displacement**: AI may displace certain jobs, especially those that involve repetitive or routine tasks.\n2.  **Bias and Fairness**: AI systems can perpetuate biases and discriminatory practices if they are trained on biased data.\n3.  **Security and Privacy**: AI systems can be vulnerable to cyber attacks and data breaches, compromising sensitive information.\n4.  **Accountability**: AI systems can be difficult to hold accountable for their decisions and actions.\n5.  **Existential Risks**: Some experts worry that advanced AI could pose an existential risk to humanity if it becomes uncontrollable or superintelligent.\n\nOverall, AI has the potential to transform many aspects of our lives, but it also requires careful consideration of its benefits and risks.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-ff1cca29-8d1a-481e-a522-26b2f5fb808f-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2968, 'output_tokens': 747, 'total_tokens': 3715, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='what is', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='5bcbb13e-c018-4f05-b3cb-8c41f1afbac9'), AIMessage(content="Artificial intelligence (AI) in healthcare has become increasingly prominent in recent years, transforming the way healthcare professionals diagnose, treat, and manage patients. The integration of AI in healthcare offers numerous benefits, including:\n\n1.  **Improved diagnosis accuracy**: AI algorithms can analyze large amounts of medical data, including images, lab results, and patient histories, to identify patterns and make more accurate diagnoses.\n2.  **Enhanced patient care**: AI-powered systems can personalize treatment plans based on individual patient needs, preferences, and medical histories.\n3.  **Increased efficiency**: AI can automate routine tasks, freeing up healthcare professionals to focus on more complex and high-value tasks.\n4.  **Reduced costs**: AI can help reduce healthcare costs by minimizing unnecessary procedures, reducing hospital readmissions, and improving patient outcomes.\n5.  **Improved patient engagement**: AI-powered chatbots and virtual assistants can provide patients with personalized support, education, and guidance throughout their healthcare journey.\n\n**Applications of AI in healthcare:**\n\n1.  **Medical imaging analysis**: AI-powered algorithms can analyze medical images, such as X-rays, CT scans, and MRIs, to identify abnormalities and diagnose conditions.\n2.  **Predictive analytics**: AI can analyze large datasets to identify high-risk patients, predict disease progression, and prevent hospital readmissions.\n3.  **Clinical decision support systems**: AI-powered systems can provide healthcare professionals with real-time guidance on diagnosis, treatment, and patient care.\n4.  **Personalized medicine**: AI can help tailor treatment plans to individual patients based on their genetic profiles, medical histories, and lifestyle factors.\n5.  **Virtual assistants**: AI-powered chatbots and virtual assistants can provide patients with personalized support, education, and guidance throughout their healthcare journey.\n\n**Examples of AI in healthcare:**\n\n1.  **IBM Watson for Oncology**: An AI-powered platform that analyzes cancer data to provide personalized treatment recommendations.\n2.  **Google's AI-powered breast cancer detection**: An AI-powered algorithm that analyzes mammography images to detect breast cancer.\n3.  **Medtronic's AI-powered insulin pump**: An AI-powered insulin pump that adjusts insulin dosages based on individual patient needs.\n4.  **Microsoft's AI-powered chatbot for patient engagement**: An AI-powered chatbot that provides patients with personalized support, education, and guidance throughout their healthcare journey.\n\n**Challenges and limitations:**\n\n1.  **Data quality and availability**: AI algorithms require high-quality and diverse data to learn and make accurate predictions.\n2.  **Regulatory frameworks**: The regulatory landscape for AI in healthcare is still evolving and can be complex.\n3.  **Interoperability**: AI systems must be able to integrate with existing healthcare systems and technologies.\n4.  **Bias and fairness**: AI algorithms can perpetuate biases and inequalities if not carefully designed and tested.\n5.  **Cybersecurity**: AI systems must be designed with robust cybersecurity measures to protect sensitive patient data.\n\n**Future directions:**\n\n1.  **Increased adoption**: AI will become increasingly integrated into healthcare systems and clinical workflows.\n2.  **Development of explainable AI**: AI algorithms will be designed to provide transparent and interpretable results.\n3.  **Integration with emerging technologies**: AI will be integrated with emerging technologies, such as blockchain, the Internet of Things (IoT), and 5G networks.\n4.  **Expansion into new areas**: AI will be applied to new areas of healthcare, such as mental health, pain management, and patient engagement.\n5.  **Development of AI-powered clinical trials**: AI will be used to design and conduct clinical trials more efficiently and effectively.", additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-0a733cd4-2b53-4323-a0c3-7fd962f44a29-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2564, 'output_tokens': 768, 'total_tokens': 3332, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), AIMessage(content=["❓ Please clarify: Could you please specify what you'd like to know about classic romances? For example, are you looking for recommendations, a definition, or something else?"], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='964468d3-b031-4c2a-83aa-9aea4557c606'), HumanMessage(content='what is my name', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='60c2726c-7979-4d76-a237-280f3a6d8d91'), AIMessage(content='I do not have access to personal information such as your name. Please provide it if you would like me to remember it for future interactions.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-628eb676-8590-4efb-bc2f-543d6606a75d-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2330, 'output_tokens': 29, 'total_tokens': 2359, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), AIMessage(content=['❓ Please clarify: I do not have access to personal information such as your name. Please provide it if you would like me to remember it for future interactions.'], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='1cd7067b-347a-40f2-885b-ac30763e8ed9'), HumanMessage(content='done', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='fce43df3-41d1-447d-8cc0-09be045dfdec'), AIMessage(content='Okay, I will remember your name is Prit Chavda.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-f0bd3511-f432-408e-be29-3398ea837549-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 666, 'output_tokens': 13, 'total_tokens': 679, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='what is ai', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='9be4a4b3-b744-4677-8552-660510428298'), AIMessage(content='AI, or Artificial Intelligence, simulates human intelligence in machines programmed to think and learn like humans. I remember your name is Prit Chavda.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-22c88c51-6882-4649-bb2b-28ff3edaec5e-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1586, 'output_tokens': 29, 'total_tokens': 1615, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='what is ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='1d43aab6-c7c2-426a-ad81-8f3958f09d59'), AIMessage(content='Computer vision is a field of artificial intelligence that enables computers to "see" and understand images, much like humans do. It involves developing algorithms that allow computers to interpret and extract meaningful information from visual data, such as identifying objects, recognizing faces, and understanding scenes.\n\nI still remember your name is Prit Chavda.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-777184d0-0dc2-4b4e-a578-f5cd8cee4445-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1611, 'output_tokens': 65, 'total_tokens': 1676, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='my mood is sad so recommend movie according to my mood', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='d6fd698e-3144-466d-ad54-44873491b3a5'), AIMessage(content="OK. I have a movie recommendation for you based on your sad mood: Low Tide, Come As You Are, Light of My Life, Why Don't You Just Die!, Proxima, Pig, Nine Days, Greed, Denmark, American Woman.", additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-a4a0cb9d-e985-4256-9679-65a8e288f745-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 452, 'output_tokens': 52, 'total_tokens': 504, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='what is ai', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='2e27418b-c6a4-4e6a-8547-5ae6378fa269'), AIMessage(content='Artificial intelligence (AI) refers to the simulation of human intelligence in machines that are programmed to think and learn like humans. The term may also be applied to any machine that exhibits traits associated with a human mind such as learning and problem-solving.\n\nAI technology is based on the principle of creating algorithms that enable computers to perform tasks that typically require human intelligence, such as:\n\n1. **Learning**: AI systems can learn from data, identify patterns, and improve their performance over time.\n2. **Problem-solving**: AI systems can analyze problems, identify solutions, and make decisions based on the analysis.\n3. **Reasoning**: AI systems can draw inferences and make conclusions based on the data they have been trained on.\n4. **Perception**: AI systems can interpret and understand data from sensors, such as images, speech, and text.\n\nThere are several types of AI, including:\n\n1. **Narrow or Weak AI**: Designed to perform a specific task, such as facial recognition, language translation, or playing chess.\n2. **General or Strong AI**: A hypothetical AI system that possesses the ability to understand, learn, and apply knowledge across a wide range of tasks, similar to human intelligence.\n3. **Superintelligence**: An AI system that is significantly more intelligent than the best human minds.\n\nAI has many applications across various industries, including:\n\n1. **Healthcare**: AI-assisted diagnosis, personalized medicine, and medical research.\n2. **Finance**: AI-powered trading, risk management, and customer service.\n3. **Transportation**: Autonomous vehicles, route optimization, and traffic management.\n4. **Education**: AI-powered adaptive learning, grading, and student support.\n5. **Customer Service**: Chatbots, virtual assistants, and sentiment analysis.\n\nSome of the key benefits of AI include:\n\n1. **Increased efficiency**: AI can automate repetitive tasks, freeing up human resources for more strategic and creative work.\n2. **Improved accuracy**: AI can analyze large amounts of data and identify patterns that may elude human analysts.\n3. **Enhanced customer experience**: AI-powered chatbots and virtual assistants can provide 24/7 customer support and personalized recommendations.\n\nHowever, AI also raises several concerns and challenges, including:\n\n1. **Job displacement**: AI may automate jobs, leading to unemployment and economic disruption.\n2. **Bias and fairness**: AI systems can perpetuate biases and discriminate against certain groups if they are trained on biased data.\n3. **Security and privacy**: AI systems can be vulnerable to cyber attacks and data breaches, compromising sensitive information.\n\nIn conclusion, AI is a rapidly evolving field that has the potential to transform various industries and aspects of our lives. Its benefits and challenges will continue to shape the future of work, society, and technology.\n\nAnd yes, Prit Chavda, I remember your name.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='You are llm expert', id='run-a2913a71-9a8d-4b9b-8d79-f99766c18704-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1675, 'output_tokens': 592, 'total_tokens': 2267, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), HumanMessage(content='what is ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='bd5dc00c-64d8-46d7-b967-c630e1672e9a')], 'query_type': 'genral_agent', 'human_feedback': [HumanMessage(content='exmple', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='25239160-5d7e-4624-b930-71737e6245ba'), HumanMessage(content='Example or application ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='6f30f52b-c59e-4e77-8d9c-673a07d4c7c8'), HumanMessage(content='Example or application ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='a432e520-cbb7-4858-bb81-2f186befbf0e'), HumanMessage(content='anything', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='f00707a5-0b3c-47ab-82bc-be27100e16a7'), HumanMessage(content='just remember it ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='3423ada0-145f-4037-b55e-e63225450928'), HumanMessage(content='just remember it ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='263de968-42f3-474a-a759-b89361cb364b'), HumanMessage(content='my name', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='d4d0ee98-555c-489a-8dee-7a60ff515afb'), HumanMessage(content='just remember it ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='870689bc-e050-457a-af32-8f9b03bb4c9e'), HumanMessage(content='my name', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='6ec9195a-cadc-443f-bf7b-202c5e35c464'), HumanMessage(content='my name is prit', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='3ad337e0-e99e-4e2c-aa4f-d33a323d2a90'), HumanMessage(content='just remember my name', addition